Call stored procedure with multiple result sets:
```java
CallableStatement cstmt = conn.prepareCall("{call sp_GetData(?)});
cstmt.setInt(1, 100);
boolean results = cstmt.execute();
int rsNumber = 1;
while (results) {
    ResultSet rs = cstmt.getResultSet();
    System.out.println("Result set " + rsNumber++);
    ResultSetMetaData meta = rs.getMetaData();
    while (rs.next()) {
        for (int i = 1; i <= meta.getColumnCount(); i++) {
            System.out.print(rs.getString(i) + "\t");
        }
        System.out.println();
    }
    rs.close();
    results = cstmt.getMoreResults(); // check for more result sets
}
cstmt.close();
```
Use `getUpdateCount()` for non-result-set returns.

